# The flat end of a reel drum: a twelve sided disc of radius 1.
#
# Twelve sides because the drum has twelve facets and the two have to
# meet: an eight sided cap on a twelve sided drum leaves four wedges of
# daylight down the side of every reel.
#
# Authored facing -Z, the same way facet.obj is, so the game stands it up
# with a yaw of plus or minus 90 degrees and each end faces outward.
mtllib drum.mtl
o cap
v 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000
v 0.000000 1.000000 0.000000
v 0.500000 0.866025 0.000000
v 0.866025 0.500000 0.000000
v 1.000000 0.000000 0.000000
v 0.866025 -0.500000 0.000000
v 0.500000 -0.866025 0.000000
v 0.000000 -1.000000 0.000000
v -0.500000 -0.866025 0.000000
v -0.866025 -0.500000 0.000000
v -1.000000 -0.000000 0.000000
v -0.866025 0.500000 0.000000
v -0.500000 0.866025 0.000000
usemtl drum
f 1 3 2
f 1 4 3
f 1 5 4
f 1 6 5
f 1 7 6
f 1 8 7
f 1 9 8
f 1 10 9
f 1 11 10
f 1 12 11
f 1 13 12
f 1 2 13
